片，相片","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3","entryId":"28030","definition":"为将事物的样子长久保存下来而用照相机拍下后在纸或电脑等上显现出的影像。","pronunciation":["사진"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17860","definition":"不知道的某时。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"e1e4a89817058245","term":"찍다","zh":"拍，拍摄","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3","entryId":"63320","definition":"用照相机照射某个物品，把其样子移动到胶片上。","pronunciation":["찍따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/05b4f999953db9c02ce0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63320-6-7-2","ko":"그거 나 고등학교 때야. 어려 보이지?","zh":"那是我高中时候拍的。看起来很年轻吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그거","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그거：那个","readings":[{"term":"그거","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62251","senseId":"2","lemma":"그거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그거","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3"}},{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"고등학교","meaning":"高中","explanation":"고등학교：高中","readings":[{"term":"고등학교","audio":"/audio/1920aafc68961592e642.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23380","senseId":"1","lemma":"고등학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고등학교","audio":"/audio/1920aafc68961592e642.mp3"}},{"text":"때야.","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때야","audio"